<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 103,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 103,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Friday's actual 103,000 and Saturday's 100,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $1.00 lower than the mid-session Friday. Top $52.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>				 Country		  Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
